1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,196
CRM dengan AI Agent biasanya mulai
sekitar 159 dolar sebulan.

2
00:00:06,196 --> 00:00:07,526
Jutaan rupiah.

3
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:10,893
Di Konektor, AI Agent-nya gratis.

4
00:00:10,893 --> 00:00:12,511
Tanpa biaya tambahan.

5
00:00:12,511 --> 00:00:15,825
Kamu cuma bayar pemakaian AI
ke OpenRouter.

6
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:18,966
Pertama, isi saldo di OpenRouter.

7
00:00:18,966 --> 00:00:21,142
Buka Credits, klik Add Credits.

8
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:28,005
Buka API Keys, klik New Key, beri
nama, lalu klik Create.

9
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:29,745
Salin kuncinya.

10
00:00:29,745 --> 00:00:32,012
OpenRouter menampilkannya cuma sekali.

11
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:36,628
Di Konektor, buka AI Wulan,
Agent dan model.

12
00:00:36,628 --> 00:00:39,806
Tempel kunci, klik Uji kunci, Simpan.

13
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:43,700
Model per tugas sudah terisi,
dengan pilihan yang murah.

14
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,680
Ganti kalau perlu.

15
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:48,653
Isi Pengetahuan: FAQ, harga, info toko.

16
00:00:48,653 --> 00:00:51,994
Agent menjawab dari datamu, bukan menebak.

17
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,265
Nyalakan Balas otomatis.

18
00:00:54,265 --> 00:00:57,561
Atur juga Serah ke tim, untuk
chat yang perlu manusia.

19
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,682
Pelanggan bertanya, agent
langsung membalas.

20
00:01:01,682 --> 00:01:02,962
Dalam hitungan detik!

21
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,489
Tips: pasang Credit limit,
supaya biaya terkendali.

22
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:11,670
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
